        <item>
            <title>2026.0.24</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 26 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202624</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2026.0.24</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Bug 修复</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>修复 PTYSession writerBox 回归：终端输入/窗口调整/CWD 获取完全失效</li>
                    <li>添加 10 秒 SSH 连接超时，防止卡死</li>
                    <li>修复 NotificationCenter 观察者泄漏（3 个观察者未移除）</li>
                    <li>修复 closePane() PTY 资源泄漏</li>
                    <li>添加 ownsSSHService 标志，防止 unsplit 时意外断开 SSH</li>
                    <li>修复 PortForwardService stopAll() 不更新状态</li>
                    <li>替换 .wait() 阻塞调用为异步 .get()</li>
                    <li>添加 SOCKS5 缓冲区边界检查和 EventLoop 线程安全</li>
                </ul>
                <h3>代码清理</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>移除死代码（TerminalScrollFix、SFTPWindowView 图标方法）</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
